              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba agooga geegooneegwa gheata aba badayda Gristo jea agadiyeesiina, ea mabeachi masaweega gwanda eara gideaba gajeesawaneegwa aba badaydaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
